    },
    "「戻す」で戻れます。ヒントの回数は減っていません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use Undo to go back. This didn't use up a hint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「戻す」は1局につき%1$lld回まで無料です。残り回数はボタンに出ています。使い切ったあとは、広告を見ると%2$lld回ぶん補充できます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You get %1$lld free undos per game. The button shows how many are left. Once they're used up, watch an ad to get %2$lld more"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「戻す」を補充できませんでした" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't Add Undos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この盤からは勝てません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Board Can't Be Won"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "そろっている並びは「（空きフリーセル + 1）×（2の空き列数乗）」枚までまとめて動かせます。いま何枚動かせるかは盤の下に出ています。置き先が空列のときは、その列は数えません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can move an ordered run of up to (empty free cells + 1) x 2^(empty columns) cards at once. How many you can move right now is shown below the board. If you're moving to an empty column, that column isn't counted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
