    },
    "何枚まとめて動かせるか" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How many cards can move at once"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部見える52枚。詰まない配札を読み切ろう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All 52 cards face up. Plan your way through a winnable deal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出題する配札は、すべて事前にコンピュータで解いてクリアできることを確かめてあります。行き止まりは配りのせいではなく、指し方で変わります。配札の番号は画面の上に出ています" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every deal has been solved by computer in advance to make sure it can be cleared. If you get stuck, it's down to how you played, not the deal. The deal number is shown at the top of the screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かしたい札をタップして選び、置きたい列・フリーセル・組札をタップします。ドラッグでも動かせます。もう一度同じ札をタップすると選択を外せます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap a card to select it, then tap a column, free cell or foundation to move it there. You can also drag. Tap the same card again to deselect it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動かせません" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "can't be moved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場札の並べ方" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Building the tableau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "場札（下の8列）には、ひとつ上の札より1つ小さくて色ちがいの札だけを置けます（黒の8 の上には 赤の7）" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the tableau (the 8 columns at the bottom), a card can only go on one that's one higher and the opposite color (a red 7 on a black 8)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "左上の4つの枠が「フリーセル」です。札を1枚ずつ一時的に置けます。ここに入れた札は、場札か組札へいつでも戻せます" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The 4 slots at the top left are the free cells. Each can hold one card for a while, and a card there can go back to the tableau or a foundation at any time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を最後まで視聴すると「戻す」を%lld回ぶん補充します。\n盤面はそのままです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Watch the ad to the end to get %lld more undo.\nThe board stays as it is."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Watch the ad to the end to get %lld more undos.\nThe board stays as it is."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見て%lld回補充する" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch an Ad for %lld More"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに盤が変わったか、画面を離れたため、ヒントを出せませんでした。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The board changed or you left the screen while the ad was playing, so no hint could be given."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ているあいだに配り直されたか、局が終わったため、補充できませんでした。\n新しい配札の「戻す」は無料の回数まで戻っています。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A new deal started or the game ended while the ad was playing, so no undos were added.\nThe new deal starts with its free undos again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "広告を見ると%lld回ぶん補充できます" : {
