        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New Deal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "札が無くなった列には、どの札でも置けます（クロンダイクのように K だけ、ではありません）。空列はフリーセル以上に強い資源です" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any card can go in an empty column (not just a K, as in Klondike). An empty column is an even stronger resource than a free cell"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "札を大きくして指で押しやすくします。はみ出した列は横にスクロールします" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Makes the cards bigger and easier to tap. Scroll sideways to see columns that don't fit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "札を拡大" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zoom in on cards"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "次に指す1手を、動かす札と行き先の列に紫の枠で示します。動かすのはあなたです" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
